      "source_xml_line": 1021,
      "string_id": "video_settings_desc_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "This setting adjusts the amount by which the visibility limit set in the current weather profile is multiplied. The range of values of this value is from 0.4 (minimum slider) to 1 (maximum slider). For example, in the weather, a viewing range of 150 meters is set. At the minimum of the slider you will see at 60 meters, at the maximum at 150.",
      "JA_current": "This setting adjusts the amount by which the visibility limit set in the current weather profile is multiplied. The range of values of this value is from 0.4 (minimum slider) to 1 (maximum slider). For example, in the weather, a viewing range of 150 meters is set. At the minimum of the slider you will see at 60 meters, at the maximum at 150.",
      "JA_new": "現在の天候設定にある視界距離に、この設定値を掛けて描画距離を調整します。値はスライダー最小の0.4から最大の1までです。たとえば天候設定の視界距離が150メートルなら、最小で60メートル、最大で150メートル先まで見えます。",
      "review_notes": null,
